<#f0f000>Character-Specific Mechanics</>
Neutral Jump Steering		_F/_B while falling
Guard Reject			^A_+^B while blocking
<#bebebe>(1000 meter required)</>

<#bebebe>(2000 meter required, final round only)
Selvaria must be knocked down to use Self Destruct.
If this move successfully hits the opponent, Selvaria
wins the match. However, it can be blocked and does
no damage to a blocking opponent. If the opponent
survives this move, Selvaria will lose the match.</>

Distortion Drive - Bonus Strike
<#bebebe>While Not Over Yet is active, Selvaria's Distortion Drives
gain the ability to inflict one of the following statuses.</>
<#ff0000>CRITICAL - +20% damage (scaling applies)</>
<#085858>PANICKED - low chance to auto dodge foe's next attack</>
<#005da0>CONTACT - removes the Rapid Cancel meter cost for
Distortion Drives</>

